      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been getting this really weird burning feeling in the middle of my chest lately. it mostly happens when i'm doing something like walking up the stairs or if i'm moving around a lot, but it goes away pretty quick if i just sit down for a minute. i'm thinking it's just bad heartburn or something, should i just take some extra Tums or something to see if it helps?",
